l":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I would go for these criteria:\r\n\r\n- Device must be from an established brand that is still on the market.\r\n- No duplicate resolutions (and safe areas). If a device has the same resolution as another device already on the list, then it should be skipped, unless it has a different safe area.\r\n  - If several devices match the same resolution/safe area combo, then the most recent device should be listed as long as it fits other criteria here.\r\n  - If resolutions/safe areas differ, only list the two most recent devices of each lineup (e.g. iPhone 16/17).\r\n\r\nThere's still the open question of how we should go about updating the list of presets across minor releases. Should we remove old device presets eventually, or keep them in until Godot 5.0 is released? They can always be recreated as custom presets after all, so perhaps keeping the list tidy is more important from an usability perspective.","created_at":"2026-07-14T16:28:26Z","updated_at":"2026-07-14T16:30:06Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111787#discussion_r3580829109","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111787","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3580829109"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111787#discussion_r3580829109"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111787"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3580829109/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1142,"original_line":1142,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3575856688,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":12,"position":12,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3580832786","pull_request_review_id":4696456769,"id":3580832786,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7VbywS","diff_hunk":"@@ -1138,6 +1139,57 @@ void EditorSettings::_load_defaults(Ref<ConfigFile> p_extra_config) {\n \t_initial_set(\"run/platforms/linuxbsd/prefer_wayland\", false, true);\n \tset_restart_if_changed(\"run/platforms/linuxbsd/prefer_wayland\", true);\n \n+\t// Resolution presets\n+\tTypedDictionary<String, Size2i> default_resolutions;\n+\tdefault_resolutions[String(\"iPhone 16\")] = Size2i(1179, 2556);\n+\tdefault_resolutions[String(\"iPhone 16 Plus\")] = Size2i(1290, 2796);\n+\tdefault_resolutions[String(\"iPhone 16 Pro\")] = Size2i(1206, 2622);\n+\tdefault_resolutions[String(\"iPhone 16 Pro Max\")] = Size2i(1320, 2868);\n+\tdefault_resolutions[String(\"iPhone 17\")] = Size2i(1206, 2622);\n+\tdefault_resolutions[String(\"iPhone 17 Pro\")] = Size2i(1206, 2622);\n+\tdefault_resolutions[String(\"iPhone 17 Pro Max\")] = Size2i(1320, 2868);\n+\tdefault_resolutions[String(\"iPhone Air\")] = Size2i(1260, 2736);\n+\tdefault_resolutions[String(\"iPad Air 11\")] = Size2i(1640, 2360);\n+\tdefault_resolutions[String(\"iPad Air 13\")] = Size2i(2048, 2732);\n+\tdefault_resolutions[String(\"iPad Pro 11\")] = Size2i(1668, 2420);\n+\tdefault_resolutions[String(\"iPad Pro 13\")] = Size2i(2064, 2752);\n+\tdefault_resolutions[String(\"Samsung Galaxy S25\")] = Size2i(1080, 2340);\n+\tdefault_resolutions[String(\"Samsung Galaxy S25+\")] = Size2i(1440, 3120);\n+\tdefault_resolutions[String(\"Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra\")] = Size2i(1440, 3120);","path":"editor/settings/editor_settings.cpp","commit_id":"6b29ca4a78341f523b03aa6b194d2a41f25b4558","original_commit_id":"6b29ca4a78341f523b03aa6b194d2a41f25b4558","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The S26 series has the same resolution as S25, might as well list that one instead (as per my above comment):\r\n\r\n```suggestion\r\n\tdefault_resolutions[String(\"Samsung Galaxy S26\")] = Size2i(1080, 2340);\r\n\tdefault_resolutions[String(\"Samsung Galaxy S26+\")] = Size2i(1440, 3120);\r\n\tdefault_resolutions[String(\"Samsung Galaxy S26 Ultra\")] = Size2i(1440, 3120);\r\n```","created_at":"2026-07-14T16:28:56Z","updated_at":"2026-07-14T16:29:08Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111787#discussion_r3580832786","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111787","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3580832786"},"html":{"href":"http